**A NEW CHALLENGE**  \

After an act of desperation and courage, Ayo finds himself separated from his mother and adrift in the ocean. Upon finding solid ground, he encounters a new and challenging land, a place full of mysteries and dangers. Face a variety of enemies, from wild animals to hostile indigenous warriors, as you explore dense forests, open fields, and dark caves.\
\

*The South Island* is an action RPG with a nostalgic pixel art style, inspired by the exploration of Zelda (SNES) and the progression system of classic Diablo.

 **\
\
FEATURES**  \

- Over 40 hand-drawn maps and special areas, exploring the local fauna and flora;
- Help the main character face unique enemies while progressing, collecting items and resources;
- Fight with native, magical, and firearm weapons: axe, spear, blowgun, bow and arrow, magic staff, and arquebus;
- Face epic bosses, unique entities, and 2D platform-style battles;
- Different mechanics in each map — discover new features as you progress through the game;
- Craft unique items: cook traditional native recipes and create local crafts using gathered resources;
- Special merchant with a full buying and selling system;
- Puzzles, mini-games, side quests, and an engaging story about a brave young boy.

 **\
\
BRAVE HERO**  \

Help Ayo overcome all challenges and rescue his mother. Face formidable enemies, solve intriguing puzzles, and explore a vibrant, lively world. Ayo's courage and determination will be tested at every step. Are you ready for this epic adventure?

 **\
\
MERCHANT**  \

No one knows where he comes from... only that he has everything you need. Buy and sell with the wandering merchant before he vanishes.

